{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43253","headline":"清露被臯兰 · 孙顾","name":"清露被臯兰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九臯兰叶茂，八月露华清。\n稍与秋阴合，还将晓色幷。\n向空罗细影，临水泫微明。\n的皪添幽兴，芊绵动远情。\n夕芳人未采，初降鹤先惊。\n爲感生成惠，心同葵藿倾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙顾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43253.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43253","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}